  <conclusion> 
    <title> Concluding Remarks/ Wrap Up </title>
    <p>Write something.... Be able to perform your own statistical investigations.... not your jam, then you'll be 
      better able to understand and critique the ... research that you'll read in other courses or that you see in the 
      media...  &amp; <alert>Play in everyone else's backyard!</alert>
   </p>
  </conclusion>
  
</subsection>
</section>
